  <item>
    <title>有人这辈子只有一次春游，有人一年有四次｜笑果编剧活动中心vol.037</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/643e78199361a4e7c3dea93e</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">643e78199361a4e7c3dea93e</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 19 Apr 2023 08:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<h2><span>简介：</span></h2><span></span><p><span>大家好，这里是「笑果编剧活动中心」。</span></p><span></span><p><span>借着我司#春日限定 演出计划，播客主理人</span><strong><span>豆豆</span></strong><span>在演出后台攒了个局，邀请了</span><strong><span>伟大爷</span></strong><span>、</span><strong><span>昌叔</span></strong><span>和</span><strong><span>赵有成</span></strong><span>，和这几位来自不同地区的朋友，</span><strong><span>聊聊他们记忆中的春游。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>记忆里的春游确实不一样，甚至有点极端，比如：伟大爷只在小学三四年级有过一次春游，而在广州的昌叔，则因为四季如春的气候，一年能有四次春游。</span></p><span></span><p><span>祝收听愉快～</span></p><span></span><h2><span>shownotes：</span></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="64">01:04</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>伟大爷这辈子只春游过一次，是在小学三四年级（长大后的叫旅游）。</span></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn."><img src="https://h9c5yqoo5i.feishu.cn/space/api/box/stream/download/asynccode/?code=MDY2Y2QzMzNjOTYzMjlkMGQzOGE1ZDA5NTVmMDVkZDdfVWNRT3ZuVE1xYjN6eEh0WFQ1c0diQmlPTnA3RGQ5NUZfVG9rZW46UDBYWGJRT05VbzFtVzh4U01CamNkaHNqbjZkXzE2ODE4MTU1NDE6MTY4MTgxOTE0MV9WNA"></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="148">02:28</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>一帮三年级的小孩去桃园春游，把桃树弄夭折、劈叉，害得桃园老板找学校打了大半年官司。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="352">05:52</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>伟大爷：学校会把春游的照片洗出来，卖给学生，全班人都挑班里最受欢迎的男生那张买。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="474">07:54</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>昌叔住在四季如春的广州，一年能有四次春游。</span></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn."></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="593">09:53</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>作为医学生的赵有成，春游内容是去山里采药。背回来的药材，都是要出题考试的。</span></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn."></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1119">18:39</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>回味一下小时候春游爱吃的零食。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1664">27:44</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>赵有成小时候种完树，得和男同学比比手上的茧子。</span></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn."></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1942">32:22</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>团建就是工作之后的春游。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2143">35:43</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>盘点一下小时候春游的尴尬时刻：</span></p><span></span><p><span>没零花钱买零食；家长偷偷骑电瓶车在后面跟着……</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2508">41:48</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>如果将来有孩子了，让他们自由地体验一次春游吧。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2806">46:46</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>赵有成的童年悲伤：出去玩后，会被妈妈要求写日记。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2880">48:00</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>适合四个男人的春游：白天钓鱼，晚上吃鱼喝酒，顺便讲讲八卦。</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lvKs89lr0R2dbXv0akTqZgjmo3Fy.m4a" length="75116281" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:51:45</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L0ZxVXBTUEUzQy1DaDlYa1hyQzBlT1NoTzdHYXoucG5n.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>毛尖x颜怡颜悦x璎宁：从小到大，我们都在比对一个抽象的「她」｜笑果编剧活动中心Vol.036</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/642ea2d966e4c00c6a5e3ad9</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">642ea2d966e4c00c6a5e3ad9</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 06 Apr 2023 10:45:44 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<h2><span>简介：</span></h2><span></span><p><span>大家好，这里是「笑果编剧活动中心」三八妇女节特辑（没错，晚了将近一个月的特辑）。</span></p><span></span><p><span>妇女节当天，我们在笑果工厂准备了一场特别活动，邀请了脱口秀演员</span><strong><span>颜怡</span></strong><span>、</span><strong><span>颜悦</span></strong><span>、</span><strong><span>璎宁</span></strong><span>和作家</span><strong><span>毛尖</span></strong><span>，围绕女性创作这件事，聊了聊各自的看法和故事（在妇女节当天拉着她们「加班」录制，挺不厚道的）。</span></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn."></p><span></span><p><span>毛尖，作家，影评人，华东师范大学教授。著有《非常罪，非常美：毛尖电影笔记》《当世界向右的时候》《例外》《有一只老虎在浴室》《乱来》《一直不松手》《永远和三秒半》《凛冬将至》等。</span></p><span></span><p><span>邀请到了毛尖老师，多亏了一些巧合，公司一位同事的朋友是毛尖老师的学生，便拜托了一下这位朋友。嗯，动用了些人际关系，谢谢这位朋友。得知要和毛尖老师对谈后，颜怡、颜悦和璎宁开始在家狂看书、做功课。</span></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn."></p><span></span><p><span>颜悦发给同事的图</span><br><span></span></p><span></span><h2><span>shownotes：</span></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="136">02:16</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>颜怡颜悦的默契翻车，自我介绍还是要事先排练。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="299">04:59</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>从《致命女人》到《瞬息全宇宙》，女性的形象越来越完整了。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="378">06:18</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>一个误区：武戏不一定比文戏低。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="834">13:54</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>女性在角色中的通约感：又能处理鸡毛碎皮的事情，又能打天打地。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1519">25:19</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>童年时期印象深刻的女性角色：</span></p><span></span><p><span>《排球女将》的小鹿纯子，《射雕英雄传》的黄蓉，《美少女战士》……</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2369">39:29</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>与妈妈的实用美学博弈，再接受它、欣赏它。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2645">44:05</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>毛尖评论的第一个女性角色：小时候说三道四的班主任。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2722">45:22</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>对家族里女性的观察：她们在隐忍地生活，我们有时候也会带刻板印象看待她们。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2812">46:52</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>颜悦对妈妈的观察：有一种把生活活成「遗愿清单」的感觉。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2869">47:49</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>在意「女性创作者」的标签吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3768">62:48</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>幽默是弱者的武器，也是智商的表现。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4022">67:02</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>脱口秀这个行业还是非常需要女性创作者。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4383">73:03</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>不是刻意从女性视角去写，而是真的写出真实生活中的女性。</span><br><span></span></p><span></span><p><span>本期对谈中聊到的片目&amp;书单：</span></p><span></span><p><span>《大城小妞》《Vicious》《睡美人》《瞬息全宇宙》《狂飙》《白莲花度假村》《流浪地球》《三体》《排球女将》《葫芦娃》《美少女战士》《射雕英雄传》《笑傲江湖》《傲骨贤妻》《三块广告牌》《包法利夫人》《秋园》《我本芬芳》《看不见的女性》</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/ljiRIIdrOUiqn7BcF-4av4VjXVKv.m4a" length="152174005" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:18:49</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L0ZzdmE0aTR3NXo5dUltWE5NNHhfZ2l0V0NzSFAucG5n.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>毛豆&amp;航哥&amp;Aiden&amp;豆豆：笑果「喜」游记 ｜笑果编剧活动中心 Vol.035</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/641ae4c673768bea35209b96</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">641ae4c673768bea35209b96</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 23 Mar 2023 07:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<h2><span>简介：</span></h2><span></span><p><span>毛豆、航哥、现场导演Aiden、豆豆，聊聊笑果「喜」游记，北美巡演中一些台前幕后的故事。巡演结束了，但试图向世界上更多的地方播撒快乐这件事会继续。祝全球朋友们收听愉快。</span></p><span></span><h2><span>shownotes：</span></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="305">05:05</a> 毛豆去泰国玩了一圈，他说就喜欢有海的地方</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="657">10:57</a> &nbsp;Aiden准备了常用设备官方英文名翻译表，但人家有行业黑话没用上</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="937">15:37</a> &nbsp;航哥第一次坐在观众席里看演出，看完之后就哭了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1181">19:41</a> 小北第一次为主持写了逐字稿（毛豆：他段子有逐字稿吗？）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1420">23:40</a> 北美的装台老师实行做四休一工作制：工作四小时，休息一小时</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1703">28:23</a> 每一场演出都是新的，从头开始出发，面对未知</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1918">31:58</a> 毛豆在洛杉矶收到了一盒卤大肠</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2126">35:26</a> Aiden遇见了一个穿花衬衫，用最大声放爵士乐，不许任何人碰他音控台的老头</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjBDBnVhxz_3rg8gT-ntC7KZXCa9.png"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2726">45:26</a> 最后一场演出时，大家心里都在想什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3056">50:56</a> 航哥一直拿咖啡机烧热水，直到遇到了胶囊咖啡机</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3245">54:05</a> 很会照顾自己的豆豆自带了拖鞋</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3697">61:37</a> Aiden一开始不习惯lunch time，后来一到十点主动邀请大家coffee</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4620">77:00</a> 脱口秀演员们在豪宅里认真吃饭</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmIjQlmeejld-H4Kkm-cKyTTkaJV.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FllRoZsjiFgW5jSgLpVpIuZzSrE7.png"></figure><span></span><p><br><span></span><br><span> </span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lihDWmJeTe5ur39rYCKBZmAZi3vN.m4a" length="119893948" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:22:39</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L0Z0RGF0THVQMmRpa2RoT1BIclFKUVg0TnNGYXMucG5n.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>先吃饭吧，吃饭令人幸福 ｜ 笑果编剧活动中心Vol.034</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/640b60a58be5d40013d16a37</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">640b60a58be5d40013d16a37</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 11 Mar 2023 04:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>简介：乐心、六件套和豆豆，「靠嘴吃饭」的脱口秀演员和编剧们，讨论好好吃饭这件事。可能会听得有点饿，你可以备点吃的，再点开收听。祝食用愉快。</span></p><span></span><p><span>Show notes：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="261">04:21</a> 乐心一个月至少有20天得吃到面食。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>（插播一个百科 ：臊子，一种由剁好的肉末或切好的肉丁炒制而成的面条卤子）</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="419">06:59</a> 乐心会和自己熟悉的上海面馆老板专门定生面。</span><br><span></span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="497">08:17</a> 六件套有次特别想吃狮子头，第二天早上就买了去扬州的车票。</span><br><span></span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="581">09:41</a> &nbsp;潮州人会卷买菜时间，为了吃到最新鲜的菜。</span><br><span></span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="851">14:11</a> 不爱吃大饭店，就爱找各种苍蝇小馆。</span><br><span></span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1057">17:37</a> 豆豆要是饿了，下一秒就得吃上，而且最好是碳水。</span><br><span></span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1382">23:02</a> 储菜的南北差异：北方人有菜窖，南方人愿意现买。</span><br><span></span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1896">31:36</a> 大家各自最拿手的一道菜是什么？</span><br><span></span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2178">36:18</a> 大蒜鲶鱼、炒腰花、炒羊肉，家宴上独有的菜</span><br><span></span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2879">47:59</a> 六件套爱看美食纪录片，而且到了当地会跟着去尝试。</span><br><span></span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3098">51:38</a> 豆豆去的箭馆旁边的葱油饼，要提前三小时定。</span><br><span></span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3976">66:16</a>《中华小当家》告诉我们，美食是让人幸福的。</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/ls3VfjkhhecGgHHkFLaVBMfwZies.m4a" length="108231501" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:14:34</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L0ZsX2xncEt5bXZMREhKSU5QNmdOa2R0RFc3SmIucG5n.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>鸟鸟：好朋友就是要一起说「地狱笑话」</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/63abf06b9acee6cd2f84e02a</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">63abf06b9acee6cd2f84e02a</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 28 Dec 2022 07:29:45 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>简介：鸟鸟、张骏、赵有成、豆豆，聊一聊友谊这件小事。那些儿时的朋友、过命的朋友、前任朋友、想象中的朋友。</span></p><span></span><p><span>祝收听愉快。</span></p><span></span><p><span>Show Notes:</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="53">00:53</a> 各位老朋友的新近况。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="210">03:30</a> 他们的初次见面：开放麦、训练营、读稿室和篮球场。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="749">12:29</a> 会主动出击交朋友的只有宋江和李诞。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="899">14:59</a> 豆豆最近去打篮球，一个队友说：「你投篮的姿势很好看。」</span></p><span></span><p><span>豆豆：一见如故！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1327">22:07</a> 张骏的中学同桌都进化成了好朋友。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1543">25:43</a> 和有成睡过一张床铺的朋友。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1669">27:49</a> 鸟鸟总是交到喜欢的画片被拍走的朋友。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2163">36:03</a> 你有跟别人绝交的经历吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2490">41:30</a> 交朋友肯定是好事，但交不到也太伤心了。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2612">43:32</a> 豆豆自创的公式：好友数/联系人总数 = 好友率（你的好友率是多少？）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3213">53:33</a> 大家友谊的小船里还涉及不到金钱。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3490">58:10</a> 网友、季度朋友和年度朋友。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3665">61:05</a> 畅想婚礼的伴郎伴娘。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3971">66:11</a>畅想得很难受，不想结了。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3994">66:34</a> 如果最近你很需要朋友，可以在评论区留下你的基本信息，不要害怕吐露一点你的缺点（也不用全是缺点），交到一个真心的朋友。</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lod4zoCZhZNdRUjUk3ECUSuG1YLe.m4a" length="106960537" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:13:42</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L0ZwYlBrTWFoQVZhRTVZRFVRd3VpOFF3dExjTkwucG5n.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>江梓浩&amp;肉食动物：喜剧周末现场速递</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/639db9e7e7ab859986035291</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">639db9e7e7ab859986035291</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 17 Dec 2022 12:45:25 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>大家好，这里是「笑果编剧活动中心」一期特别的现场报道。</span></p><span></span><p><span>前段时间，我们举办了今年的喜剧周末，把播客也搬到了活动现场，由我司漫才爱好者文森特担任主持，和江梓浩、肉食动物一起聊聊漫才、线下和脱口秀大会。我们精选了一部分话题，希望能让没来现场的你也听一听，他们的想法。</span></p><span></span><p><span>祝收听愉快。</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果你有任何反馈意见，欢迎在评论区给我们留言。</span></p><span></span><p><span>时间线小提示：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="168">02:48</a> 梓浩和肉食动物最开始是怎么接触漫才的？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="357">05:57</a> 漫才和脱口秀创作逻辑的不同</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="458">07:38</a> 《脱口秀大会》上的昌叔梓浩</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="647">10:47</a> 肉食动物直面《脱5》评论</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="793">13:13</a> 听说今年漫才训练营有超厉害的新人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="910">15:10</a> 提问梓浩：你还会讲漫才吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="997">16:37</a> 是什么让你们坚持做喜剧？</span></p><span></span><p><span>剪辑：豆豆&amp;阿萱</span></p><span></span><p><span>编辑：千寻</span></p><span></span><p><span>封面设计：旎旎</span></p>]]></description>
