  <item>
    <title>千禧年请回答：那些陪我们长大的电子产品</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/639972ec3a2b7eba5ceb466b</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">639972ec3a2b7eba5ceb466b</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 14 Dec 2022 06:53:30 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>简介：本期我们找来了公司的魔方大师、特斯拉车主</span><strong><span>乔易</span></strong><span>，每年都会定时收看苹果发布会的</span><strong><span>吴星辰</span></strong><span>，正在报复性消费购入游戏掌机的</span><strong><span>豆豆</span></strong><span>，一起聊一聊那些记忆中的和进行时的电子产品。</span></p><span></span><p><span>Show Notes:</span></p><span></span><p><u><em><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="174">02:54</a></span></strong></em></u></p><span></span><p><strong><span>豆豆、吴星辰和乔易各自拥有的第一个电子产品。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><u><em><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="359">05:59</a></span></strong></em></u></p><span></span><p><strong><span>「人类的本质是复读机」十年后的孩子还知道复读机吗？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><u><em><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="793">13:13</a></span></strong></em></u></p><span></span><p><strong><span>全键盘手机时代我们学会的技能：盲打。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><u><em><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1010">16:50</a></span></strong></em></u></p><span></span><p><strong><span>网费5块钱，流量30M的时代。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><u><em><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1408">23:28</a></span></strong></em></u></p><span></span><p><strong><span>报复性消费买掌机的豆豆。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><u><em><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1593">26:33</a></span></strong></em></u></p><span></span><p><strong><span>长大了，有钱了，但没时间和欲望玩游戏了。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><u><em><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1903">31:43</a></span></strong></em></u></p><span></span><p><strong><span>最近买的电子产品：乔易的电推子，豆豆的Air tag，吴星辰的电热毯。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><u><em><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2417">40:17</a></span></strong></em></u></p><span></span><p><strong><span>乔易拿过魔方比赛的冠军，还赢了一台Ipad 3。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><u><em><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2710">45:10</a></span></strong></em></u></p><span></span><p><strong><span>PSP让吴星辰发现朋友在游戏里的重要性。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><u><em><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3253">54:13</a></span></strong></em></u></p><span></span><p><strong><span>未来的电子产品会更重社交吗？现代人真的太孤独了。</span></strong></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/luhc3yrqyE3N8eP8bBsBxv3kEUOm.m4a" length="116534812" type="audio/mp4"/>
