  <item>
    <title>训练营导师广播站：孩子，你怎么当爸的？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/639042950d56158ecbb89ab2</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">639042950d56158ecbb89ab2</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 07 Dec 2022 07:36:52 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>简介：</span></p><span></span><p><span>大家好，这里是训练营导师广播站，每个月参与笑果训练营的导师会「租借」笑编活的地盘，聊一聊他们的话题。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期的主催人是脱口秀演员悟饭，上次聊过怎么培养段子，追本溯源，他想找几个有经验的朋友，聊聊怎么培养孩子。 我们帮悟饭找来了有全职奶爸经验的</span><strong><span>小块</span></strong><span>；去年为陪妻子迎接小生命、缺席《脱口秀大会》总决赛的</span><strong><span>大木</span></strong><span>；和没有孩子、但今年提出了非著名理论「这孩子要是生下来就能养我」的</span><strong><span>童漠男</span></strong><span>。</span></p><span></span><p><span>祝收听愉快。</span></p><span></span><p><span>Show Notes:</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="104">01:44</a>小块：「为什么想聊孩子？是最近家里闯祸了？」</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="292">04:52</a> 还没孩子的童漠男很好奇，永远把自己放在第二位是什么体验？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="622">10:22</a> 各位大人小时候怎么当孩子的？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="901">15:01</a> 大木小时候家长管得严，导致他如今很逆反。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1239">20:39</a> 悟饭想玩音乐的火苗给掐灭了，耿耿于怀。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1406">23:26</a> 如果孩子将来问你要一百万创业，你会给吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span>童漠男：那怎么能给；大木：那就要谈谈股份；悟饭：给两千差不多得了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1682">28:02</a> 悟饭有一个控制欲超强的家长，现在他变成了让孩子撒开疯玩的家长。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1873">31:13</a> 孩子上了初中可能也不稀罕你陪。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2548">42:28</a> 小块今年一轮游，回去遭孩子教育：「你别老玩手机，好好写你那脱口秀」。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2759">45:59</a> 你是你小时候理想中的家长形象吗？</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lk_Zvda3OkfYoEOIql2TP0GCVChe.m4a" length="86208594" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:59:26</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L0ZvQXcyVFhDbnlLRXRzZXo3UlZtSDg2MlBSMlEucG5n.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>《脱5》导演组幕后大复盘</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/637de5b1f6753f4e9d4d55bc</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">637de5b1f6753f4e9d4d55bc</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 23 Nov 2022 09:19:43 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>简介：</span></p><span></span><p><span>来自《脱口秀大会5》导演组的幕后复盘。</span></p><span></span><p><span>Show Notes:</span></p><span></span><p><u><em><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="243">04:03</a></span></strong></em></u></p><span></span><p><span>导演组的朋友们心里都给第五季打几分？</span></p><span></span><p><span>p.s. 路过的杨笠给总决赛打了9.8分</span></p><span></span><p><u><em><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="708">11:48</a></span></strong></em></u></p><span></span><p><span>程哥真的没画眼影，我们调整了灯光和妆发</span></p><span></span><p><u><em><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="967">16:07</a></span></strong></em></u></p><span></span><p><span>为什么在几个备选城市里最终选择了青岛？</span></p><span></span><p><u><em><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1680">28:00</a></span></strong></em></u></p><span></span><p><span>导演组给每个人都买了保险，还给天花板舞台配了120和急救</span></p><span></span><p><u><em><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1755">29:15</a></span></strong></em></u></p><span></span><p><span>每个人心里的脱5高光时刻，那些高情感浓度的片段</span></p><span></span><p><u><em><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2492">41:32</a></span></strong></em></u></p><span></span><p><span>海选会有大概的框架，但我们也会挖掘特别的人</span></p><span></span><p><u><em><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3071">51:11</a></span></strong></em></u></p><span></span><p><span>有争议，但我们知道这是爱之深，责之切</span></p><span></span><p><u><em><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3201">53:21</a></span></strong></em></u></p><span></span><p><span>观众越来越专业了，拉表格做赛制分析，比导演组还严谨</span></p><span></span><p><u><em><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3374">56:14</a></span></strong></em></u></p><span></span><p><span>犀利提问时间：今年内部梗会不会稍微有一点点多呢？</span></p><span></span><p><u><em><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3628">60:28</a></span></strong></em></u></p><span></span><p><span>揭秘大王奖杯价格（呼兰到现在还没拿到他的奖杯）</span></p><span></span><p><u><em><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3746">62:26</a></span></strong></em></u></p><span></span><p><span>豆豆的人形坐牌有点像被压成纸皮的汤姆猫</span></p><span></span><p><u><em><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3887">64:47</a></span></strong></em></u></p><span></span><p><span>那些遗憾的脱5瞬间，也许当时那样就好了</span></p><span></span><p><u><em><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4081">68:01</a></span></strong></em></u></p><span></span><p><span>如果还有脱6，我们希望……</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lvCSvU_NW5KKXspshjhTkzf7Cqoi.m4a" length="111732872" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:17:02</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L0Z1U1VCQ1pUbUNQeC1oYmh5bHlhZzFfMTZ2eDIucG5n.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>训练营导师广播站：我们真是来教你写段子的</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/631c201c8212a6185470e3e8</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">631c201c8212a6185470e3e8</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 10 Sep 2022 05:26:52 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>简介：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>大家好，欢迎收听「笑果编剧活动中心」第一个子栏目——「</span><strong><span>训练营导师广播站</span></strong><span>」试播期。</span></p><span></span><p><span>去年教师节，我们找曾经是教辅老师的童漠男和张灏喆聊了英语学习；今年找到四位来自笑果训练营的导师：王梓晗、悟饭、肉食动物，聊聊喜剧学习。</span></p><span></span><p><span>这些朋友目前都在笑果始终免费的 Comedian Pro 和飞行计划担任导师，四处传播一点喜剧的种子。他们会回答一个终极的问题：</span><strong><span>脱口秀和漫才，能教吗？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>祝各位听众度过一个愉快的中秋节和教师节。</span></p><span></span><p><span>以后有机会，可以来跟本期嘉宾学学喜剧。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Show Notes:</span></strong></p><span></span><p><u><em><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="185">03:05</a></span></strong></em></u><span> 训练营模式：比赛，淘汰，可以参考鱿鱼游戏(放心，我们不会杀死你的喜剧信心。)</span></p><span></span><p><u><em><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="250">04:10</a></span></strong></em></u><span> 噗哧训练营入营之前会发一件带有橘黄色的统一服装</span></p><span></span><p><u><em><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="470">07:50</a></span></strong></em></u><span> 学讲脱口秀之前，先学表达</span></p><span></span><p><u><em><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="550">09:10</a></span></strong></em></u><span> 梓晗会像检查零件一样检查你的段子</span></p><span></span><p><u><em><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1105">18:25</a></span></strong></em></u><span> 悟饭的喜剧科普小课堂开课啦</span></p><span></span><p><u><em><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1205">20:05</a></span></strong></em></u><span> &nbsp;肉食动物，两个失意脱口秀演员的漫才组合</span><u><em><strong><span>3</span></strong></em></u></p><span></span><p><u><em><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5">0:05</a></span></strong></em></u><span> &nbsp;梓晗的「喜剧错题集」，能帮学员少走弯路</span></p><span></span><p><u><em><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2505">41:45</a></span></strong></em></u><span> &nbsp;没有一种段子是不值得讲的</span></p><span></span><p><u><em><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3070">51:10</a></span></strong></em></u><span> 豆豆，王勉，徐志胜，童漠男都上过悟饭的入门课</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/luexwkjfxHIBGSaO4Flsxat56zhV.m4a" length="89659325" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:01:49</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L0ZzeWVkWGJzS2R4YXI2SkNkM0xxOHZsbm1HbUwucG5n.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
